{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/releases/422652669","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/releases/422652669/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/releases/422652669/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/releases/tag/v5.2.3","id":422652669,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOLAFUFM4ZMSr9","tag_name":"v5.2.3","target_commitish":"main","name":"v5.2.3: Faster cache key computation in large workspaces","draft":false,"immutable":true,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-24T10:05:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T10:06:20Z","published_at":"2026-10-24T10:05:40Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/tarball/v5.2.3","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/zipball/v5.2.3","body":"The cache key no longer comes from searching the whole workspace for mise config files. In repos that already contain `node_modules` or `vendor/bundle`, this removes a delay of several minutes in \"Restoring mise cache\".\n\n## Fixed\n\n- **\"Restoring mise cache\" no longer takes minutes after installing dependencies.** To build the cache key, the action used to match about 25 `**/…` glob patterns. That meant it walked every subdirectory of the workspace, including `node_modules` and `vendor/bundle`, before checking the cache at all. When the action ran after a step like `pnpm install` or `ruby/setup-ruby` with `bundler-cache: true`, this could take 3–7 minutes. The action now looks for mise config files the same way mise does: only in the working directory and each parent directory up to the workspace root. It checks for `mise.toml`, `.mise.toml`, `.config/mise/…`, `conf.d` fragments, `.tool-versions`, and their local, env-specific and `.lock` variants. The step also logs `Hashed mise config files in N.Ns`. ([#703](https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/pull/703) by @jdx and @corsicanec82)\n  - If you set a custom `cache_key` that doesn't use `{{file_hash}}` or `{{default}}`, the action no longer hashes config files at all.\n  - Config files in subdirectories, such as monorepo sub-projects, no longer affect the cache key. mise only loads them with `--monorepo`.\n  - Cache keys change, so the first run after you upgrade will miss the cache.\n\n## New Contributors\n\n* @corsicanec82 made their first contribution in [91e7f82](https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/commit/91e7f82) (#703)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/compare/v5.2.2...v5.2.3","mentions_count":2}